{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24960","headline":"山中有怀李十二 · 牟融","name":"山中有怀李十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林前风景晚苍苍，林下怀人路杳茫。\n白发流年淹旧业，碧山茅屋卧斜阳。\n客边秋兴悲张翰，病里春情笑沈郎。\n何事登楼□□□，几回搔首□思归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24960.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24960","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}